{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And thirty days and three days.</b> He decreed concerning the male according to the number of days in which its form is completed in the womb, and the female double. And this matter is tested and proven." "<b>In the bloods of purification.</b> The construct of <b>דמי</b> does not expel (the nun of the plural), the construct of <b>ימי</b> does expel (it). And your sign is <b>את יום צאתך</b>."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:36.265880689Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}